From f683776bb7700ead8c73c45b089e556568508ae3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: MegaCadeDev <garylikovic@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 14:30:00 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] PS5: boot Minecraft, keep Infamous 2 moving, light NeverDead

Minecraft's disc extra deadlocked the title thread, and its theme package was rejected for paths that still stay inside dev_hdd0. A started PPU missed its wakeup, and the random-number syscall opened /dev/urandom.

Infamous 2 keeps the movie on Mega ASMJIT blocks and compiles SPURS as Safe. usleep waits on a private word so SPU stores do not cancel it. MWAITX does not honor its timer here, so reservation waits use clock_nanosleep. Relaxed ZCULL avoids a GPU flush every frame.

NeverDead's lighting reads the color buffer back, so Write Color Buffers is turned on for BLUS30654 and BLES01303 only.

Co-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>
